# Node.js the installer vendors into /opt/vault/node when the host has no root-owned Node >= 24 (design section 9).
# Read by scripts/release.sh and baked into install-vault.sh. The hashes are those of
#   https://nodejs.org/dist/v${NODE_VERSION}/SHASUMS256.txt   (node-v${NODE_VERSION}-linux-x64.tar.xz / -linux-arm64.tar.xz)
# To bump: take the new version and both lines from that file, nothing else.
